(7629354, 1236318, 2333, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by salmiakki:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kirbic:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey, you were in Milwaukee? Wish I''d have known, would have bought you lunch! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Shame on me!  I didn''t realise you were close to Milwaukee.  I''ve been working in Madison for the last 3 weeks and was at a loose end that weekend. Used to visit Milwaukee art museum frequently when I lived in Chicago, but that was BC (Before Camera). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Madison''s a fun town... weather''s been kinda crap for you though!</td>', 'Originally posted by salmiakki: Originally posted by kirbic: Hey, you were in Milwaukee? Wish I''d have known, would have bought you lunch!  Shame on me!  I didn''t realise you were close to Milwaukee.  I''ve been working in Madison for the last 3 weeks and was at a loose end that weekend. Used to visit Milwaukee art museum frequently when I lived in Chicago, but that was BC (Before Camera).   Madison''s a fun town... weather''s been kinda crap for you though!', '2019-05-13 20:37:50.000000', NULL, 0),
