(7629386, 1236109, 67145, '<td valign="top">very disappointing when i see the votes .. <br/>its a wonderful image .. especially when taking minimal into account .. <br/>it can be disheartening when seeing the breakdown of votes on your image and the comparison with other photos in a challenge . <br/>but i spose everyone has an opinion .. and we''re all different .. <br/>i try and separate myself from feeling disappointed when something i put in doesnt do as well as i would hope .. but sometimes that difficult to do .. i think of it as an opportunity for personal development .. !! .. often not achieved ..  ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'very disappointing when i see the votes .. its a wonderful image .. especially when taking minimal into account .. it can be disheartening when seeing the breakdown of votes on your image and the comparison with other photos in a challenge . but i spose everyone has an opinion .. and we''re all different .. i try and separate myself from feeling disappointed when something i put in doesnt do as well as i would hope .. but sometimes that difficult to do .. i think of it as an opportunity for personal development .. !! .. often not achieved ..  ;) ', '2019-05-14 03:10:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7629395, 1236241, 3306, '<td valign="top">Hi Roz,<br/>   Sorry I didnt get to comment on your image during the challenge. This was one of my favorites. I can just imagine you driving down the street and your companion checking things out as you drive along. I love his seat cushion! It is also notable that your drivers side is on the opposite side of us in the U.S.A.  This picture was captivating to me because it represents real life and tells the viewer about you as a person. It stands out with personality that many of the other images do not as they are just artistic pictures of windows and dont say anything to the viewer other than they are pretty. Well done and thank you for letting us into your life!</td>', 'Hi Roz,   Sorry I didnt get to comment on your image during the challenge. This was one of my favorites. I can just imagine you driving down the street and your companion checking things out as you drive along. I love his seat cushion! It is also notable that your drivers side is on the opposite side of us in the U.S.A.  This picture was captivating to me because it represents real life and tells the viewer about you as a person. It stands out with personality that many of the other images do not as they are just artistic pictures of windows and dont say anything to the viewer other than they are pretty. Well done and thank you for letting us into your life!', '2019-05-14 07:10:37.000000', NULL, 0),
